 new firearms and melee weapons, more refined than ever\n- Audio improvements\n- Performance optimizations\n- Various small fixes\n- More reliable AI pathfinding\n- Updated game balance\n- Support for bHaptics equipment\n\nThe next major update will focus on multiplayer, so stay tuned!\nAs always, thank you for the great feedback and support, it really helps shape the game.", "created_date": 1772827691, "id": "34197048969938877", "version": "1.2.5", "version_code": 122, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23943098495334027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "34197048969938877"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1772826218, "id": "34196737163303391", "version": "1.2.5", "version_code": 121, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23943098495334027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "34197048969938877"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1772823850, "id": "34196234723353635", "version": "1.2.5", "version_code": 120, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"